        "slc_d619167c1db9de0d97fd638cdf3b921ed141d9eede5627eee44d259205e9a063"
      ],
      "text": "The architecture treats a typed event stream as the contract: providers, renderers, the TUI, and custom frontends all consume events rather than the core rendering UI itself."
    },
